&lt;p&gt;We’re InterWorks, a people-first technology consultancy, and we’re looking for an IT Systems Engineer to join our team in Tulsa, Oklahoma. This is a client-facing role for someone who combines strong technical expertise with professionalism, curiosity and a solutions-oriented mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
