&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please be advised that this role is required to be located in the InterWorks Tulsa office in Tulsa, Oklahoma. Remote work or telecommuting arrangements outside of this jurisdiction are not permissible for this position.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
